{"seq":3,"slug":"sleep-and-health","title":"睡眠与健康","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/sleep-science/sleep-and-health","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sleep-and-cognitive-function","title":"睡眠与认知功能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/sleep-science/sleep-and-health/sleep-and-cognitive-function","wordCount":2091,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"sleep-metabolism-and-immunity","title":"睡眠、代谢与免疫","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/sleep-science/sleep-and-health/sleep-metabolism-and-immunity","wordCount":2055,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"sleep-disorders-overview","title":"睡眠障碍概览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/sleep-science/sleep-and-health/sleep-disorders-overview","wordCount":1996,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"睡眠与健康\">睡眠与健康</h1><p>本章聚焦睡眠质量和时长对人体各系统的广泛影响——从大脑认知到代谢免疫，再到临床睡眠障碍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内容概要\">内容概要</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>睡眠与认知功能</strong>：睡眠如何影响记忆巩固、注意力、决策能力和创造性思维</li>\n<li><strong>睡眠、代谢与免疫</strong>：睡眠不足对胰岛素敏感性、食欲激素、免疫细胞活性的损害机制</li>\n<li><strong>睡眠障碍概览</strong>：失眠症、阻塞性睡眠呼吸暂停、不宁腿综合征等常见疾病的识别与分类</li>\n</ul>\n<p>理解睡眠的健康维度，能为后续学习睡眠优化策略提供充分的动机与科学依据。</p>\n"}